002:str> \"12\",\n]","html":"<span class=\"token tag\">!!map</span>\n<span class=\"token tag\">!!str</span>\n<span class=\"token tag\">!!seq</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># https://yaml.org/spec/1.2/spec.html#c-ns-tag-property</span>\n\n<span class=\"token tag\">!&lt;tag:yaml.org,2002:str></span> <span class=\"token key atrule\">foo</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token tag\">!&lt;!bar></span> baz\n\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> <span class=\"token tag\">!local</span> foo\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> <span class=\"token tag\">!!str</span> bar\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> <span class=\"token tag\">!e!tag%21</span> baz\n\n<span class=\"token tag\">!!seq</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n  <span class=\"token tag\">!&lt;!local></span> <span class=\"token string\">\"foo\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token tag\">!&lt;tag:yaml.org,2002:str></span> <span class=\"token string\">\"bar\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token tag\">!&lt;tag:example.com,2000:app/tag!></span> <span class=\"token string\">\"baz\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Assuming conventional resolution:</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"12\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> <span class=\"token number\">12</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> <span class=\"token tag\">!</span> <span class=\"token number\">12</span>\n\n<span class=\"token tag\">!!seq</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n  <span class=\"token tag\">!&lt;tag:yaml.org,2002:str></span> <span class=\"token string\">\"12\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token tag\">!&lt;tag:yaml.org,2002:int></span> <span class=\"token string\">\"12\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span cla